    [
     1,
     "It would be good to see the Dlambda parameterisation used - \r\nI concocted it a while back\r\n\r\nfor someone who then disappeared. There is still a slim case that open-population models give more defensible/reliable confidence intervals, but the closed option is a good start.<br><div></div><div>Murray<br></div>"
    ],
    [
